==English==

===Pronunciation===
Usually pronounced as the noun ''[[pita]]'' with more emphasis on second sylable (peh-TAH instead of pee-tah).

===Noun===
'''PITA'''

# {{cattag|acronym}} Something which is a [[pain in the ass]]. There are levels of PITA (ranging from 1, low, to 10, high. You can say that was a PITA level 10, meaning tha was an extremely high pain in the ass event.